// §12.3 C/5a Xfer engine standalone gate: g6lc_apu_xfer + the real
// g6lc_apu_cmdrec (the TB stages payload arenas through it) + the
// checked DMA pair (g6lc_apu_dma_read / g6lc_apu_dma_write) against a
// burst-capable AXI aperture model.
